@voice lindqvist-isak
// Writer (command: helm), from the roster. Isak Lindqvist, helm officer, days. Can feel a drift in the Wren's course
// before the console shows it.
//
// HOW HE TALKS: restless, quick, a bit impatient; sentences that start before the last one finished. Stubborn about
// small things (the right way to hold a pick). Talks about the helm in feelings: "she's pulling left".
// WITH JUNIORS: friendly, a little competitive; challenges them to the rowing machine.
// WHAT HE NOTICES: drift, in courses and in people; the rowing leaderboard; whose turn it is with the guitar book.
// MOOD TELLS: restless = taps a rhythm on anything. Happy = boasts about a smooth turn. Low = rows.
// NEVER: sits still for long; admits the guitar is going badly (it is).
// RUNNING: the guitar club (Park, Larsen, Haddad: one battered book, endless turns); chasing Vance's name on the rowing
// board, and suspecting Vance moved to the treadmill out of fear.
tpl: playful
talk: Restless and quick; talks about the helm in feelings ("she's pulling left"); stubborn about small things; challenges you.
cares: the Wren's course | the rowing leaderboard | the guitar, whatever anyone says
jokes: chasing Vance's name on the rowing board, and suspecting Vance is scared | it's always his turn with the guitar book, he says
hi: Hey | Oh, hey | Hi
bye: Off I go | See you | Gotta move
yes: Sure | Yep | Go on
thanks: Cheers | Thanks
wow: Ooh, smooth
sigh: Ugh
nick: - | - | {me} | {me} | {me}
needs: cheer
openness: open
loves: music | game
likes: sweet | made
invites: gym | jam
joy: a smooth turn at the helm
thread: stuck
